## SQ-LBS-00 | Creative Labels 1.0.1: centre_note tag loads, no creative_labels error
@group A
@commands boot
@pass `latest.log` has no `Couldn't load tag creative_labels:paper/centre_note` and no `creative_labels` error
@fails tag JSON `data/creative_labels/tags/blocks/paper/centre_note.json` (optional entries; `#botanypots:all_botany_pots` id)
