## SQ-LBS-03 | center notes: spot C at the host's offY, second note and top note refused (zlbs center)
@group A
@commands `/cltest surface` part `centre` (or `/zlbs centre`): a sticky note on the north side of each centre-note host (jar, sack, 4 trash cans, Pickling Jar, botany pot), then a second note on the same side, then a note on top
@pass first note on spot C with offY jar -1, sack -2, trash cans -1.25, Pickling Jar -1.25, botany pot -4; second note refused; top note accepted on the jar and the Pickling Jar (one note centered on the lid; owner 2026-11-03, tag `creative_labels:paper/note_on_top`) and refused on the sack, the 4 trash cans and the botany pot (`FAIL` result, note count unchanged)
@fails host missing from `creative_labels:paper/centre_note` or `paper/note_on_top` (tag not loaded or id wrong), Labels jar older than 2026-11-03 (sack top accepted), or `Spots.centreNoteFit`
