## SQ-LBS-04 | host set to air: label and written note drop, cell air (zlbs refit, after -01 and -03)
@group A
@commands `/zlbs refit` after -01 and -03 (hosts set to air with `setBlockAndUpdate`, flag 3); first line is a control: a wall torch on a stone host that goes to air; last line (10 ticks later) a piston pushing a noted stone host. By hand once: a labelled stone broken in survival
@pass control: a torch drops; every host: the label (blank) and the note (with its Text) drop as item entities at the cell, the cell is air (20 of 20); piston line PASS (note dropped with Text, cell air); survival break drops the label
@fails control drops nothing too: every block drop is skipped (Creative Worldgen `FirstTickWater` flag; needs the 2026-11-03 Worldgen jar, which clears it each level tick); control drops but paper does not: `FacePaperInteractions.hostChanged` / `refit`
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
> zlbs refit
waitlog \[zlbs\] DONE refit 60
count \[zlbs\] PASS refit == 20
reject \[zlbs\] FAIL
look the label drops are blank (no NBT), the note drops carry their Text

## SQ-LBS-05 | old save from 1.0.0 (sB_1) on 1.0.1: notes and labels kept, no OffX / OffY / Size keys
@group A
@commands Old saves: boot once with `creativeLabels-1.0.0.jar` (from `jar_archive/` or `mods/` before the install), `/cltest place` and `/cltest labels`, `save-all`, stop; swap in 1.0.1, boot the same level
@pass every note and label still in place with the same spots; face NBT has no `OffX`/`OffY`/`Size` keys until a host changes
@fails `FaceContent.load` defaults (`Size` absent must read as 10)
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
@superseded old save from Creative Labels 1.0.0 (pack 1.1.06), migration shipped in Creative Labels 1.0.1 (pack 1.2.00) (owner, 2026-11-18)
> zlbs dump -4 -4 170 14
waitlog \[zlbs\] DONE dump 60
expect \[zlbs\] INFO dump \S+ \S+ \S+ \S+: [1-9]\d* face_paper block entities
reject \[zlbs\] be .*\b(OffX|OffY|Size)\b
shell pre=$(for f in $(ls logs/*.log.gz | grep -v debug); do zcat "$f"; done | grep -o '\[zlbs\] be .*' | sort); post=$(grep -o '\[zlbs\] be .*' logs/latest.log | sort); echo "pre $(printf '%s\n' "$pre" | grep -c 'be ') post $(printf '%s\n' "$post" | grep -c 'be ')"; diff <(printf '%s\n' "$pre") <(printf '%s\n' "$post") && echo SAME
look rows/SQ-LBS-05.shell.txt: SAME, or only differences that keep every note and label with the same spots (and no OffX / OffY / Size key); the pre lines come from sB_1's rotated log

## CQ-LBS-01
@group client
@commands In the SQ-LBS-01/-03 world: look at each label and centred note up close, show an item on the botany pot label (sneak + right-click), feather for the name
@pass LOOK: labels flat on each block's surface, no gap over 1 px, the botany pot label smaller and filling the pot's height, icon and name scaled with it; centered notes in the middle of each side, not floating
@fails `LabelQuads.map` / `LabelLayout.at` with the `Place` (client), `FacePaperModel` cache key
@draft needs the SQ-LBS-01/-03 hosts in the client world: copy tools/scratch_query/zlbs_probe.js into the client kubejs/server_scripts, /reload, /zlbs labels and /zlbs centre, then a look and shot per host from the positions in that probe; write those steps with the probe open
